<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pemex awards 19 pct pay hike to workers.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex awards 19 pct pay hike to workers.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's state-owned oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) agreed to award a 19 percent pay hike to unionized workers from August 1, the Labour Ministry said Thursday.</p>
<p>In a statement, the ministry said that Pemex also agreed to give an additional one percent in benefits.</p>
<p>The pay hike was worked out between Pemex and the Union of Mexican Petroleum Workers. It covers to the collective work contract over the period 1997-1999, the ministry added.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530))</p>
